flowchart TD
    A[业务 Queue] --> B[Consumer]
    B --> C[业务失败]
    C --> D[Spring Retry]
    D --> E{还失败?}
    E -->|是| F[MessageRecoverer]
    F --> G[Retry Queue]
    G --> H[TTL 5s]
    H --> I[DLX 回业务 Queue]
    I --> B
    F -->|达到最大轮数| J[Dead Exchange]
    J --> K[DLQ]
    K --> L[DeadLetterConsumer]
    L --> M[MANUAL ACK]
